## Expected Behavior After Patch:

### 1. Channel Start with Cooldown:
```
[COOLDOWN] Checking cooldowns for 43 streams in channel xxx
[COOLDOWN] Profile 579 for stream 1187282 on cooldown - blocked for 9m 45s
[COOLDOWN] Found 1 cooled profiles for channel xxx
Channel assigned stream 1187282 profile 582  ← NOT 579!
```

### 2. Channel Stop:
```
Cleaned up 89 Redis keys for channel xxx
Preserved 2 cooldown keys for channel xxx  ← NEW!
```

### 3. Channel Restart (after 10s):
```
[COOLDOWN] Checking cooldowns for 43 streams
[COOLDOWN] Profile 579 for stream 1187282 - blocked for 9m 35s  ← STILL COOLED!
[COOLDOWN] Found 1 cooled profiles
Channel assigned profile 582  ← Cooldown working!
```

